=2 Walkthrough
!East Ronfaure.jpg||East Ronfaure
!Ranguemont Pass-map.jpg||Ranguemont Pass
* Speak with {p:Halver} for a cutscene to begin the Mission.
** You will need to zone after the previous Mission to trigger this cutscene.
** You will receive {@k} {k:Missive to Altennia} after the cutscene.
* Head to {z:Ranguemont Pass}.
** {p:Survival Guide} (Fauregandi/Ranguemont Pass) is the fastest way to get there.
*** Otherwise zone in from {z:East Ronfaure} at (K-4).
* Touch the **Vicious Claw Marks** at (J-8) to begin a confrontation with **Harnessed Smilodon** (WAR).
** Has approximately 35k HP.
** Uses {p:Mighty Strikes}.
* Touch the **Vicious Claw** Marks again after defeating the tiger for a cutscene with Altennia.
* Return to Halver for a cutscene.
* Click the **Door:Prince Royal's RM** located at (H-7) Northern Door in the Central Garden for another cutscene.
* Head to {z:Bostaunieux Oubliette} from the Chateau.
** Your destination is on the top floor, so __don't__ drop down the pit at E-7/8.
* Touch the **Frigid Confluence** at (H-9) top floor to begin a confrontation with Trion.
** Possesses very high defense. Approximately 25k HP.
** Uses {p:Invincible} at low hp.
** He can use it as soon as he is down to 75% hp remaining.
** Fight ends with a short cutscene.
* Speak with {p:Curilla} in the **Temple Knight's Quarters** for a final cutscene and your reward.
** You might need to speak to her more than once if she has other quests for you.

